From f906fd45c8ad9c755b2ed1166a08d954e0956d74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 13:18:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] compositor: Add background blur support

Add a MetaBackgroundBlur helper that owns the redraw-clip filter needed by
framebuffer-sampled blur. Keeping construction and destruction in the
background-effect module keeps the stage filter bookkeeping local to the
effect implementation.

Surface actors track the requested blur region, expand their paint volume
to cover the sampled pixels, and paint the blurred background before
painting the surface contents. Opaque-region culling is adjusted so
background pixels needed by the blur are not discarded.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/merge_requests/5071>
